					"content": "咳…咳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡齐娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060910,
					"content": "很不舒服吧，卡齐娜，马上就没事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060911,
					"content": "我们赶紧回圣火竞技场去吧，出发之前火神大人说，会为我们安排医生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060912,
					"content": "嗯，你们最好都检查一遍，不要留下隐患。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恰斯卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060913,
					"content": "我好像没什么感觉，你呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060914,
					"content": "完全没感觉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060915
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 50060915,
					"content": "也是啊，你好像根本不害怕深渊力量这种东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060916,
					"content": "我们快走吧，除了治疗，在「夜神之国」获得的信息也需要分享。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060917,
					"content": "对哦，大灵提到的火神的计划，那个到底是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060918,
					"content": "由她来告诉你们吧，现在我们都是计划的一员了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						50060919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 50060919,
					"content": "我们的一举一动，都关联着纳塔的命运。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				}
			]
		},
